<title>USA: Liuski names new president, CFO.</title>
<headline>Liuski names new president, CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NORCROSS, Ga. 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liuski International Inc said Tuesday that Chih-Hung Liao has been named president.</p>
<p>He succeeds Manual Tan.</p>
<p>Liao, who in June purchased 41 percent of Liuski from its founder, Morries Liu, also assumed the positions of chairman and chief executive previously held by Liu.</p>
<p>In addition, the company said Martin Tsai has been named chief financial officer, succeeding interim CFO Ed Williams.</p>
<p>Liuski is a national wholesale distributor of microcomputer peripherals, components and accessories.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
